  "local_modification_note": "2026-10-03: credited MIT apps/imu fusion adds serialized timestamped snapshots, owned calibration settings, same-step orientation publication and invalid-update recovery. Calibration persistence accepts an explicit settings copy so learned bias remains saveable. Historical inherited_from hashes and reference notices remain unchanged; current files hashes reflect these local modifications. No new upstream source or clean-room claim. 2026-10-03: imu_main now reserves a single producer during task startup, preserves pending stop requests, stops draining on shutdown, retries interrupted polls and resets stationarity without zero-rate initialization. Current source hashes cover these local MIT modifications; original grants, inherited hashes and historical binary evidence are unchanged. 2026-10-03: credited MIT producer now exposes guarded asynchronous lifecycle/snapshots, uses source timestamp intervals, validates 300ms freshness/gaps and follows each sample ODR/FSR for stationarity. Inherited reference hashes remain unchanged. 2026-10-03: configured base stores the transpose of physical basis columns so vectors project along declared front/Y/top axes; original credited geometry and inherited hashes remain intact."
